# SN56 upstream validator baseline — reviewed pin.
#
# The pre-entry probe compares gradients-ai/G.O.D main with this exact commit
# and fails closed on drift.  Updating this file is a review decision, not a
# way to silence the probe: diff every validator/evaluation, tournament,
# dataset, and trainer change and record the finding before changing the pin.
#
# Reviewed 2026-08-23: a2b14db2 was assessed IMAGE-safe relative to f7caab6c.
# The three intervening commits (1) delay trainer SUCCESS until checkpoint
# upload completes after a timeout, including image tasks, (2) correctly
# re-rank all valid submissions during re-finalization, including image tasks,
# and (3) avoid a GRPO reference-model OOM.  The image scoring weights,
# diffusion evaluator, per-type image evaluation constants, and tournament
# scheduling are unchanged.

